Coordinated Capture	KEY:Coordinated Capture ~ Combat	CATEGORY:Feat	TYPE:Combat.Teamwork	DESC:You and your allies can coordinate to hinder enemies from escaping your threats.	PRINCL:1,BAB=1	SOURCEPAGE:p.44
Covering Fire ~ Feat	KEY:Covering Fire ~ Feat	CATEGORY:Feat	TYPE:Combat.Teamwork	DESC:Your ranged firearm strikes impose penalties on enemy attacks against allies who also share this feat.	PRINCL:1,FEAT=Exotic Weapon Proficiency (Firearm)	SOURCEPAGE:p.44
Musketeer's Daring	KEY:Musketeer's Daring	CATEGORY:Feat	TYPE:Combat.Panache	DESC:Roll extra d6s on movement-based checks when rolling a natural 5 or 6 on derring-do.	PRINCL:1,STAT=DEX(15),CLASSLevel=Swashbuckler(6)	SOURCEPAGE:p.56
Musketeer's Dodge	KEY:Musketeer's Dodge	CATEGORY:Feat	TYPE:Combat.Grit	DESC:Gain a dodge bonus to AC and ignore attacks of opportunity when using gunslinger dodge movement.	PRINCL:1,FEAT=Exotic Weapon Proficiency (Firearm),CLASSLevel=Gunslinger(3)	SOURCEPAGE:p.56
Musketeer's Reposition	KEY:Musketeer's Reposition	CATEGORY:Feat	TYPE:Combat.Grit	DESC:Perform a reposition maneuver instead of a knockdown when hitting an opponent with a pistol-whip.	PRINCL:1,FEAT=Exotic Weapon Proficiency (Firearm),CLASSLevel=Gunslinger(6)	SOURCEPAGE:p.56
Musketeer's Sidestep	KEY:Musketeer's Sidestep	CATEGORY:Feat	TYPE:Combat.Panache	DESC:Gain a dodge bonus to AC and avoid attacks of opportunity during dodging panache movements.	PRINCL:1,CLASSLevel=Swashbuckler(3)	SOURCEPAGE:p.56
Protective Line	KEY:Protective Line ~ Feat	CATEGORY:Feat	TYPE:Combat.Teamwork	DESC:Avoid triggering attacks of opportunity while reloading firearms when adjacent to an ally with this feat.	PRINCL:1,FEAT=Exotic Weapon Proficiency (Firearm)	SOURCEPAGE:p.56
Plague Resistance	KEY:Plague Resistance	CATEGORY:Feat	TYPE:General	DESC:Roll ability damage or drain twice and take the lower result when infected with a disease.	PRINCL:1,STAT=CON(13)	SOURCEPAGE:p.68
Reap the Infirm	KEY:Reap the Infirm	CATEGORY:Feat	TYPE:Combat	DESC:Deal extra precision damage against diseased targets using weapon attacks.	PRINCL:1,BAB=3	SOURCEPAGE:p.68
Balor Whip	KEY:Balor Whip	CATEGORY:Feat	TYPE:Combat	DESC:Pull distant foes closer to you without moving when executing a whip drag maneuver.	PRINCL:1,FEAT=Whip Mastery,BAB=8	SOURCEPAGE:p.80
Greater Balor Whip	KEY:Greater Balor Whip	CATEGORY:Feat	TYPE:Combat	DESC:Increase critical threat range and confirmation bonuses when performing whip drag attacks.	PRINCL:1,FEAT=Balor Whip,BAB=16	SOURCEPAGE:p.80
Improved Balor Whip	KEY:Improved Balor Whip	CATEGORY:Feat	TYPE:Combat	DESC:Make a single melee attack against a dragged target using your off-hand weapon.	PRINCL:1,FEAT=Balor Whip,BAB=12	SOURCEPAGE:p.80
Twin Fang Lunge	KEY:Twin Fang Lunge	CATEGORY:Feat	TYPE:Combat	DESC:Move up to twice your speed and strike with both weapons simultaneously using Twin Fang Style.	PRINCL:1,STAT=DEX(15),FEAT=Quick Draw,FEAT=Twin Fang Style,BAB=8	SOURCEPAGE:p.105
Twin Fang Strike	KEY:Twin Fang Strike	CATEGORY:Feat	TYPE:Combat	DESC:Attack with both primary and off-hand weapons during a single attack action.	PRINCL:1,STAT=DEX(15),FEAT=Quick Draw,FEAT=Twin Fang Style,BAB=6	SOURCEPAGE:p.105
Twin Fang Style	KEY:Twin Fang Style	CATEGORY:Feat	TYPE:Combat.Style	DESC:Reduce an opponent's armor bonus to AC when hitting them with both paired weapons in a full attack.	PRINCL:1,STAT=DEX(15),FEAT=Quick Draw,BAB=1	SOURCEPAGE:p.105
